A plan's copy of a leaf is followed even after other writes ran since the
plan made it, which may have split or freed it (#754).
Guarded-by: "blind tree: a path is replayed to its leaf\, or to the plan's copy of it until another write\, and missed after a split"

diff --git a/bytecaskdb/blind_btree.cppm b/bytecaskdb/blind_btree.cppm
index a7d70663..694dd305 100644
--- a/bytecaskdb/blind_btree.cppm
+++ b/bytecaskdb/blind_btree.cppm
@@ -1515,7 +1515,7 @@ public:
     const auto at = node_address(cur);
     if (at == p.leaf && cur->tag == p.leaf_tag)
       return Route::kSame;
-    if (at == f.now && f.write == writes_)
+    if (at == f.now)
       return Route::kFollowed;
     return Route::kKey;
   }
